  "instructions": [
    "Heat the butter in a hot pot vessel over medium heat.",
    "Add the onion and garlic and cook until the onion is translucent.",
    "Add the Norwegian currants and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the rice and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the chicken broth, salt, black pepper, and turmeric, and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low, cover, and simmer for 20 minutes.",
    "Fluff the pilaf with a fork and serve hot.",
    "Garnish with fresh herbs if desired.",
    "Cook poultry to an internal temperature of 74°C / 165°F before serving."
